  "id": "microbursts-30-30",
  "name": "Microbursts 30/30",
  "description": "Three 10-second max efforts in the warm-up, then two sets of ten 30-second bursts at 130 % FTP with 30 seconds easy. The two sets are written out, since ZWO has no nested repeats.",
